{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"springboot-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Spring Boot Snippets","description":"Controllers, services, repositories, entities, configuration and tests for Spring Boot in Java and Kotlin.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Java / C#","path":"snippets/java-c.json"},{"language":"Kotlin","path":"snippets/kotlin.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/java-c.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Application\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbapp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@SpringBootApplication\",\n      \"public class ${1:Application} {\",\n      \"    public static void main(String[] args) {\",\n      \"        SpringApplication.run(${1:Application}.class, args);\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The application class\"\n  },\n  \"REST controller\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbctrl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@RestController\",\n      \"@RequestMapping(\\\"/api/${1:items}\\\")\",\n      \"public class ${2:Item}Controller {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    private final ${2:Item}Service service;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    public ${2:Item}Controller(${2:Item}Service service) {\",\n      \"        this.service = service;\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @GetMapping\",\n      \"    public List<${2:Item}> all() {\",\n      \"        return service.findAll();\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A REST controller\"\n  },\n  \"GET mapping\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@GetMapping(\\\"/${1:{id}}\\\")\",\n      \"public ${2:Item} get(@PathVariable ${3:Long} id) {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GET endpoint\"\n  },\n  \"POST mapping\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbpost\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@PostMapping\",\n      \"@ResponseStatus(HttpStatus.CREATED)\",\n      \"public ${1:Item} create(@Valid @RequestBody ${1:Item} body) {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A POST endpoint\"\n  },\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbsvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Service\",\n      \"public class ${1:Item}Service {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    private final ${1:Item}Repository repository;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    public ${1:Item}Service(${1:Item}Repository repository) {\",\n      \"        this.repository = repository;\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service\"\n  },\n  \"JPA repository\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbrepo\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public interface ${1:Item}Repository extends JpaRepository<${1:Item}, ${2:Long}> {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A repository\"\n  },\n  \"Entity\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbent\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Entity\",\n      \"public class ${1:Item} {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @Id\",\n      \"    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\",\n      \"    private Long id;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @Column(nullable = false)\",\n      \"    private String ${2:name};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A JPA entity\"\n  },\n  \"Configuration bean\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbbean\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Bean\",\n      \"public ${1:Type} ${2:name}() {\",\n      \"    return new ${1:Type}($0);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A bean\"\n  },\n  \"Exception handler\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbadvice\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@RestControllerAdvice\",\n      \"public class ${1:Api}ExceptionHandler {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @ExceptionHandler(${2:NotFoundException}.class)\",\n      \"    @ResponseStatus(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND)\",\n      \"    public Map<String, String> handle(${2:NotFoundException} e) {\",\n      \"        return Map.of(\\\"error\\\", e.getMessage());\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A controller advice\"\n  },\n  \"Value property\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbvalue\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Value(\\\"\\\\${${1:app.name}}\\\")\",\n      \"private String ${2:name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@Value\"\n  },\n  \"Web MVC test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbmvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@WebMvcTest(${1:Item}Controller.class)\",\n      \"class ${1:Item}ControllerTest {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @Autowired MockMvc mvc;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @Test\",\n      \"    void returnsOk() throws Exception {\",\n      \"        mvc.perform(get(\\\"/api/${2:items}\\\")).andExpect(status().isOk());\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A @WebMvcTest\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/kotlin.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Application\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbkapp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@SpringBootApplication\",\n      \"class ${1:Application}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"fun main(args: Array<String>) {\",\n      \"    runApplication<${1:Application}>(*args)\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The application\"\n  },\n  \"REST controller\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbkctrl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@RestController\",\n      \"@RequestMapping(\\\"/api/${1:items}\\\")\",\n      \"class ${2:Item}Controller(private val service: ${2:Item}Service) {\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    @GetMapping\",\n      \"    fun all(): List<${2:Item}> = service.findAll()\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A REST controller\"\n  },\n  \"Data class entity\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbkent\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Entity\",\n      \"data class ${1:Item}(\",\n      \"    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\",\n      \"    val id: Long? = null,\",\n      \"    val ${2:name}: String,\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An entity\"\n  },\n  \"Repository\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sbkrepo\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"interface ${1:Item}Repository : JpaRepository<${1:Item}, Long>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A repository\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Spring Boot Snippets\n\nControllers, services, repositories, entities, configuration and tests for Spring Boot in Java and Kotlin.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 15 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Java / C# | `sbapp` | The application class |\n| Java / C# | `sbctrl` | A REST controller |\n| Java / C# | `sbget` | A GET endpoint |\n| Java / C# | `sbpost` | A POST endpoint |\n| Java / C# | `sbsvc` | A service |\n| Java / C# | `sbrepo` | A repository |\n| Java / C# | `sbent` | A JPA entity |\n| Java / C# | `sbbean` | A bean |\n| Java / C# | `sbadvice` | A controller advice |\n| Java / C# | `sbvalue` | @Value |\n| Java / C# | `sbmvc` | A @WebMvcTest |\n| Kotlin | `sbkapp` | The application |\n| Kotlin | `sbkctrl` | A REST controller |\n| Kotlin | `sbkent` | An entity |\n| Kotlin | `sbkrepo` | A repository |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}